{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"相对张量积"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"相对张量积"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在具有"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"单纯余极限"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中, 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":" $A$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数上的模","text":"右模"}},{"Plain":" $M$ 与左模 $N$, 可作<strong>相对张量积</strong>\n$$\r\nM\\otimes_A N := \\operatorname{colim}_{\\Delta} M\\otimes A^{\\otimes\\bullet}\\otimes N.\r\n$$\n注意 $M\\otimes_A N$ 一般没有 $A$-左模或右模结构.</p>\n<p>这一构造在"},{"Local":{"url":"单子","text":"单子"}},{"Plain":"的情形 (或者说是 “范畴化”) 又称"},{"Local":{"url":"双边杠构造","text":"双边杠构造"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>张量积也可以理解为 $\\mathcal C$-"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":"之间的"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}A\\to\\mathcal C$ 的复合 ("},{"Local":{"url":"余端","text":"余端"}},{"Plain":")\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_{\\mathbf{B}A} M\\otimes N.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>自由消解</h3>\n<p>对于结合代数 $A$ 上的左模 $N$, 自然映射 $A\\otimes_A N \\to N$ 为等价. 这给出了 $N$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由"}},{"Plain":"消解\n$$\r\nN = \\operatorname{colim}_\\Delta A^{\\otimes\\bullet+1}\\otimes N.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}